WEBVTT

00:00:00.953 --> 00:00:01.763
Acme Corp wants an AI

00:00:01.803 --> 00:00:03.243
Engineer to build its clinic

00:00:03.283 --> 00:00:04.103
assistant.

00:00:04.143 --> 00:00:05.123
Here is what the role

00:00:05.163 --> 00:00:05.723
asks for.

00:00:06.755 --> 00:00:07.848
The must-haves.

00:00:07.888 --> 00:00:08.688
LLM agents.

00:00:08.728 --> 00:00:10.178
Retrieval with citations.

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:11.880
Evaluation with test

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:11.978
sets.

00:00:12.018 --> 00:00:13.218
And clear writing for people

00:00:13.258 --> 00:00:14.403
who aren't engineers.

00:00:15.458 --> 00:00:16.533
Here is how the assistant

00:00:16.573 --> 00:00:17.312
fits together.

00:00:17.352 --> 00:00:18.623
A staff question goes to

00:00:18.663 --> 00:00:19.513
the agent.

00:00:19.553 --> 00:00:20.963
The agent searches the clinic's

00:00:21.003 --> 00:00:21.743
policies.

00:00:21.783 --> 00:00:22.963
The answer comes back with

00:00:23.003 --> 00:00:23.783
its sources.

00:00:24.883 --> 00:00:25.821
Now your match.

00:00:25.861 --> 00:00:26.951
Retrieval is a match.

00:00:26.991 --> 00:00:28.408
Evaluation is a match.

00:00:28.448 --> 00:00:29.331
Agents are a match.

00:00:29.371 --> 00:00:30.201
Healthcare is a gap,

00:00:30.241 --> 00:00:31.321
but it's only a nice

00:00:31.361 --> 00:00:31.942
to have.

00:00:32.803 --> 00:00:33.772
And the best part.

00:00:33.812 --> 00:00:34.902
The ad says it plainly.

00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:36.692
Visa sponsorship available for the

00:00:36.732 --> 00:00:37.888
right candidate.

00:00:38.925 --> 00:00:39.813
So the plan.

00:00:39.853 --> 00:00:41.298
Lead with your evaluation suite,

00:00:41.338 --> 00:00:42.428
mention your agent,

00:00:42.468 --> 00:00:43.843
and apply this week.

